{"name": "Cubic Haikus - hikikomori", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Cubic Haikus: hikikomori - A minimalistic poetic adventure\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/7ff06fa1df9da7f32ef3c5c3a16691e1.poster.avif?t=1785550834\" width=\"776\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/7ff06fa1df9da7f32ef3c5c3a16691e1.webm?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/7ff06fa1df9da7f32ef3c5c3a16691e1.mp4?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sucked into a digital world made out of your mind, you will need to navigate the fragmented memories of a recluse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cubic Haikus: hikikomori</strong> is a minimalistic, physics-based narrative puzzle where colors govern the rules of reality and poetry unlocks the path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/8889a8f4b1c95cd886a08f5b0026eecb.poster.avif?t=1785550834\" width=\"776\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/8889a8f4b1c95cd886a08f5b0026eecb.webm?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/8889a8f4b1c95cd886a08f5b0026eecb.mp4?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped inside your monitor after a sudden outburst of rage, you awaken as a solitary white cube in a surreal, but familiar, landscape. To find your way through it, you must manipulate the environment by shifting your color. The world reacts to what you emit. Match your hue using Color Emitters to activate circuits, clear physical obstacles or detonate the blockades keeping your memories locked away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/625256ad00f6125dd48db5ddb54f48af.poster.avif?t=1785550834\" width=\"776\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/625256ad00f6125dd48db5ddb54f48af.webm?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/625256ad00f6125dd48db5ddb54f48af.mp4?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you push through these distinct emotional chapters, you will uncover the haikus that tell your story. These poems are the key to progression, unlocking the pieces of a life left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/2f95a7c9a282fac674404019ac4e9bfc.poster.avif?t=1785550834\" width=\"776\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/2f95a7c9a282fac674404019ac4e9bfc.webm?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/2f95a7c9a282fac674404019ac4e9bfc.mp4?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, the way you align the final colors will dictate your fate. Your choices will lead to one of three distinct conclusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/0e26df2110045ead30035598e2d4f017.poster.avif?t=1785550834\" width=\"776\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/0e26df2110045ead30035598e2d4f017.webm?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/extras/0e26df2110045ead30035598e2d4f017.mp4?t=1785550834\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>No rush, no deaths, just a poetic journey into yourself.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Trapped inside your monitor, navigate your fragmented mind in this minimalistic physics-based narrative puzzle. Shift your color to manipulate the world around you and uncover the hidden haikus that will guide you through a poetic journey into yourself.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743130/cadd186e7d5c57bc5bbd840070ac804d04e44a7c/header.jpg?t=1785550834", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Interactive Fiction", "Puzzle Platformer", "Adventure", "Multiple Endings", "Casual", "Atmospheric"], "developers": "JOOKITOOZ", "publishers": "JOOKITOOZ", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4743130", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/WdGcAWxpBH0", "first_seen": 1780099200.0}